 do mes,  mas o nome sera funcionarios do século, aqui estão os funcionarios preserve o rosto deles deve ser como um cartas e todos os funcionarios devem estar de vermelho roupas simples  menos a mulher ela deve estar de social azul ela deve ser pouco mais morena  e o homem que esta com roupa de prirata deve estar com social branca sem gravata o mural deve ser em angulo reto</span></span><div class="h-4 w-[1px] border-l flex-shrink-0 border-(--grok-border-secondary)"></div><span class="flex-shrink-0">Utilizar</span></div><div data-desktop-composer="" class="query-bar group/query-bar z-10 relative w-full overflow-hidden @container/input bg-[var(--grok-bg-elevated)] border border-[color:var(--grok-border-secondary)] focus-within:border-[color:color-mix(in_oklab,var(--grok-border-secondary),var(--grok-border-primary)_50%)] [box-shadow:var(--grok-elevation-composer)] [--pill-cutout:var(--grok-bg-elevated)]" style="transition-property: background-color, box-shadow, border-color; transition-duration: 100ms; transition-timing-function: ease-in-out; --border-t-radius: 29px; --border-b-radius: 29px; border-radius: 29px;"><div class="relative"><div class="pe-14 ps-3 py-0" style="padding-inline-end: 44px;"><div class="max-h-14 overflow-hidden [&amp;_.tiptap]:!overflow-clip [&amp;_.tiptap&gt;p:first-child]:line-clamp-1 [&amp;_.tiptap&gt;*:not(:first-child)]:!h-0 [&amp;_.tiptap&gt;*:not(:first-child)]:!overflow-hidden [&amp;_textarea]:!whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_textarea]:!overflow-hidden"><div class="relative min-h-[52px]" data-testid="chat-input"><div dir="auto" style="border-bottom: 0px solid transparent; border-top: 0px solid transparent;"><div contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-label="Pergunte ao Grok qualquer coisa" aria-disabled="false" translate="no" class="tiptap ProseMirror w-full px-2 bg-transparent focus:outline-none text-fg-primary align-bottom query-bar-editor overflow-y-auto !max-w-none prose [&amp;_ul&gt;li&gt;p]:my-0 [&amp;_ol&gt;li&g