 rainy window\",\"Rock anthem about friends laughing over spilled drinks at a backyard bash\",\"Country twang tells the story of an old guitar found in the attic\",\"K-pop energy shows a dancer spinning under glowing city billboards alone\",\"Folk melody follows a traveler finding a note in an abandoned cabin\",\"Rap flow describes a chef's secret recipe winning over a tough crowd\",\"Pop tune about the joy of finding your favorite song on an old mixtape\"],\"story\":[\"A shy librarian discovers her overdue books hold hidden love notes\",\"Two strangers realize they have been swapping apartments without knowing it\",\"An inventor creates a gadget that reveals everyone's true thoughts at dinner\",\"A gardener learns her prize roses are actually growing from buried secrets\",\"A delivery driver keeps finding messages meant for his future self\",\"A musician plays songs that make listeners forget their worst memories\",\"A barista notices customers leaving clues about a missing treasure map\",\"A tailor sews clothes that change the wearer's personality overnight\",\"A traveler meets someone who knows every detail of his unwritten life\"],\"episode\":[\"A chef explains the secret ingredient that surprises every dinner guest\",\"A sailor recounts the unexpected visitor who boarded his ship at sea\",\"A writer describes the plot twist that changed her entire novel\",\"A runner shares how a stray dog joined her marathon training\",\"A mechanic talks about the car that fixed itself overnight\",\"A painter reveals the model who inspired her most colorful work\",\"A teacher discusses the lesson that left her class in stitches\",\"A traveler explains the custom that turned her vacation upside down\",\"A musician recalls the gig where the audience sang every word\"],\"idea\":[\"A librarian who hides encouraging notes inside returned library books\",\"The bartender who remembers every customer's first drink order perfectly\",\"A gardener who swears his flowers bloom better with 